Date>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 22:32:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/metropolitan-opera-snake-handler-animal-auditions-mozart/</guid></item><item><title>这些行业将在未来十年引领招聘，仅一个行业就占所有新增就业岗位的三分之一以上</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/top-industries-hiring-next-decade-ai-utilities-healthcare-jobs/</link><description>医疗保健和社会救助行业将在未来十年增加220万就业机会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1393129186-e1788640950766.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 22:05:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/top-industries-hiring-next-decade-ai-utilities-healthcare-jobs/</guid></item><item><title>墨西哥贩毒集团越来越多地使用载有炸弹的无人机和简易爆炸装置。 “我们面临着暴力的不断加剧”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/mexican-drug-cartels-bomb-laden-drones-improvised-explosive-devices-jalisco-new-generation-sinaloa-zacatecas/</link><description>哈利斯科新一代卡特尔（CJNG）和锡那罗亚卡特尔多年来一直在争夺萨卡特卡斯的控制权。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292395876-e1788639729408.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 20:28:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/mexican-drug-cartels-bomb-laden-drones-improvised-explosive-devices-jalisco-new-generation-sinaloa-zacatecas/</guid></item><item><title>美国特使史蒂夫·威特科夫和贾里德·库什纳在俄罗斯和平努力期间首次访问乌克兰之前再次会见普京</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/us-envoys-steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-putin-ukraine-war-peace-effort/</link><description>普京和乌克兰总统泽伦斯基均同意在会谈期间暂停对对方首都的袭击。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26248632986964-e1788638662456.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 20:12:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/us-envoys-steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-putin-ukraine-war-peace-effort/</guid></item><item><title>在特朗普发誓要花费“任何必要的资金”后，MAGA Inc. 